"macro":{"as_of":"2026-09-24","points":[{"text":"The CBE held rates on 24 September, with the discount rate at 19.50%.","src":["Sharjah24"]},{"text":"Headline inflation eased to 14.3% in June, but the IMF expects it to rise to 16.7% in H2 2026, which delays convergence to target by about a year.","src":["Daily News Egypt"]}]},"external":{"as_of":"2026-09-24","points":[{"text":"Net international reserves reached $57.2bn at end-August, and remittances hit $47.3bn in FY2025/26.","src":["CBE"]},{"text":"The current account deficit is estimated at 4.5% of GDP for FY2025/26, and gross reserves were 119% of the IMF's ARA metric at end-June.","src":["Daily News Egypt"]}]},"fiscal":{"as_of":"2026-09-24","points":[{"text":"Egypt is the textbook case of an interest burden. Interest payments reached 11% of GDP in FY2024/25.","src":["Egypt MoF Medium-Term Debt Strategy"]},{"text":"A rights-group analysis of the 2025/26 budget found interest equal to about 87% of expected tax revenue.","src":[]},{"text":"On the other side, the primary surplus is projected to rise from 4.8% to 5% of GDP in FY2026/27, and the government is targeting debt/GDP of 78% by June 2027.","src":[]}]},"debt":{"as_of":"2026-09-24","points":[{"text":"Refinancing is the key risk for a pitch. The CBE projects 2026 external debt service of $29.18bn.","src":["SIS"]},{"text":"Total external debt was $161.2bn at end-September 2025, with 19.2% of it short-term.","src":["SIS"]},{"text":"IMF: completing the seventh EFF review unlocked about $1.8bn, bringing total disbursements to about $7.3bn. The EFF has been extended through December 15, 2026.","src":["ArabFinance","IMF"]}]},"valuation":{"as_of":null,"points":[{"text":"Add Eurobond and T-bill yields to the bonds list. USD bond prices have no free API.","src":[]}]},"catalysts":{"as_of":"2026-09-24","points":[{"text":"The EFF runs to December 15, 2026. What replaces it is a catalyst worth flagging.","src":["IMF"]}]}},"narrative_pending":false,"derived":{"interest":{},"